// Team-owned locations and memories: ONE shared instance per team, keyed by
// the team name — `location X on T:Red` creates a single pile owned by the
// team (found via the bare name while a Red member is current, or via
// `X of T:Red`), and `memory M on T:Red` creates the single slot `Red_M`.
player P1, P2, P3
turnorder (P:P1, P:P2, P:P3)
team Red with (P:P1, P:P2)
location TeamPile on T:Red
memory TeamFlag on T:Red

stage Play for current 2 times {
  TeamFlag is 5
  cycle to next
}
